      <Parent z:Ref="i1" />
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Name>CCRb_AEB_On</Name>
      <Comment>Car-To-Car Rear braking: Approach to braking target with 50 km/h. 
The distance between front bumper of ASM vehicle and rear bumper of fellow vehicle is 12 or 40 m. The deceleration of the braking fellow vehicle is 2 or 6 m/s2.
With this logical test case 'AEB Inter-Urban' systems that work at higher velocities are tested.</Comment>
      <Enabled>true</Enabled>
      <Duration>100</Duration>
      <ConcreteTestCases>
        <d2p1:anyType z:Id="i1204" i:type="ConcreteTestCase">
          <ExecutedBy i:nil="true" />
          <IsReportLinkInvalid>true</IsReportLinkInvalid>
          <LastExecution i:nil="true" />
          <LastModification i:nil="true" />
          <ModifiedBy i:nil="true" />
          <ReportPath></ReportPath>
          <Verdict>Undefined</Verdict>
          <Anchor></Anchor>
          <Comment>The distance defined via Alias leads to a distance of 12 m between front bumper of ASM vehicle and rear bumper of fellow vehicle. </Comment>
          <ConcreteFunctions>
            <d2p1:anyType z:Id="i1205" i:type="ValidationFunctionConcrete">
              <Result z:Id="i1206" i:type="ValidationFunctionResult">
                <ResultContent z:Id="i1207" i:type="NoResult">
                  <ResultContentType>NoContent</ResultContentType>
                </ResultContent>
                <Verdict>Undefined</Verdict>
              </Result>
              <ValidationFunction z:Id="i1208" i:type="EvaluationFunctionCustom">
                <Comment>Verifying, whether the normalized score of the AEB system exceeds the value 0.5. The randomly chosen value is not part of the NCAP assessment protocol (for more details see custom evaluation function).</Comment>
                <Id>1</Id>
                <Parameters z:Id="i1209">
                  <anyType z:Id="i1210" i:type="ValidationParameterCurrentSignal">
                    <Id>1</Id>
                    <Type>CurrentSignal</Type>
                    <Name>Sensors.Collision_Sensor.Collision_Sensor_1.SensorOutput.v_Collision_CoG_Vehicle_Total[m|s]{1} (Environment)</Name>
                    <LayoutName>Env_CollisionSensor</LayoutName>
                  </anyType>
                  <anyType z:Id="i1211" i:type="ValidationParameterConstant">
                    <Id>2</Id>
                    <Type>Constant</Type>
                    <Value>50</Value>
                  </anyType>
                  <anyType z:Id="i1212" i:type="ValidationParameterCurrentSignal">
                    <Id>3</Id>
                    <Type>CurrentSignal</Type>
                    <Name>Sensors.Collision_Sensor.Collision_Sensor_1.SensorOutput.v_Rel_Collision_Point_Total[m|s]{1} (Environment)</Name>
                    <LayoutName>Env_CollisionSensor</LayoutName>
                  </anyType>
                  <anyType z:Id="i1213" i:type="ValidationParameterConstant">
                    <Id>4</Id>
                    <Type>Constant</Type>
                    <Value>3</Value>
                  </anyType>
                </Parameters>
                <Type>Evaluation</Type>
                <Function>Custom</Function>
                <Path>Functions\EuroNCAP_AEB_CCR_Validation.py</Path>
              </ValidationFunction>
            </d2p1:anyType>
            <d2p1:anyType z:Id="i1214" i:type="ValidationFunctionConcrete">
              <Result z:Id="i1215" i:type="ValidationFunctionResult">
                <ResultContent z:Id="i1216" i:type="NoResult">
                  <ResultContentType>NoContent</ResultContentType>
                </ResultContent>
                <Verdict>Undefined</Verdict>
              </Result>
              <ValidationFunction z:Id="i1217" i:type="EvaluationFunction">
                <Comment>Verifying, whether the lateral deviation is within tolerance.</Comment>
                <Id>2</Id>
                <Parameters z:Id="i1218">
                  <anyType z:Id="i1219" i:type="ValidationParameterCurrentSignal">
                    <Id>1</Id>
                    <Type>CurrentSignal</Type>
                    <Name>Plant.VehicleMovement.Positions.Vehicle.Linear.Pos_Vehicle_CoorSys_E[x;y;z][m].Pos_y_Vehicle_CoorSys_E[m] (VehicleDynamics)</Name>
